        Isle("The Unnumbered Sea",8,"The Back of Noon","Hester, watchmaker",
            "Here the noon gun casts a second shadow pointing away from the sun. Hester has been setting the harbor clocks by that shadow. Her granddaughter is now legally older than her mother.","A clock hand that points to supper",
            Crossing("noon-gun",SeaDuty.Sounding,"Noon by Appointment","The gunner will only fire if two ships agree on the time. Sail to either side of the walking shadow with the same watch.","Take simultaneous bearings on the false noon.","Meridian Mackerel","The clocks agree. The shadow is the shadow of Gauge’s engine, sweeping the district once a day.",8,Sound,Track,Relay),
            Landfall("noon-clock","An Hour in the Pantry","An iron time chest in the clockmaker’s pantry holds all the disputed birthdays. A clockwork cuckoo has eaten the winding key.","Brass Cuckoo","The birthday list comes out with four entries for Jo. She demands four cakes.",8,
                At(Haul,Fallen,"Winding fork","Draw the fork from the cuckoo’s crop"),At(Seat,West,"Clock arbor","Seat the fork in the pantry arbor"),At(Turn,East,"Birthday chest","Open the watchmaker’s birthday chest")),
            Crossing("noon-run",SeaDuty.Convoy,"Birthday Convoy","Gauge’s examiners want the clocks back on engine time. Hester sends the children to their birthday party aboard a ship in every available time zone.","Get the birthday flotilla past the engine shadow.","Leap Second","For one afternoon everybody has the day off. Sima pilots the cake barge with particular care.",8,Tow,SeaJob.Guide,DriveOff),
            Landfall("noon-hand","A Clock Without a Face","The town has agreed to keep the bells and give up the hours. Hester will replace the face with an open window overlooking the harbor.","Dial Wolf","The first bell means the first boat is in. The last bell means somebody has made stew. Nobody misses an appointment.",8,
                At(LandingAction.Cut,West,"Blind clockface","Cut the old face from the frame"),At(Brace,East,"Bell wheel","Brace the wheel under the window"),At(LandingAction.Guide,Stairs,"New bellkeeper","Escort the youngest watchmaker to the noon rope"))),
        Isle("The Unnumbered Sea",8,"Pennyweight Wake","Tern, ballast inspector",
