            Crossing("penny-weigh",SeaDuty.Salvage,"Five Men and a Coat","The crew’s counterweights are in a pile on the seabed. Their clothes have grown green beards of weed.","Recover the crew ballast without sinking the suspended boat.","Debt Skate","One weight wears a much too large coat. Pip recognizes her father’s patch on the sleeve.",8,Track,SeaJob.Salvage,Unload),
            Landfall("penny-balance","A Man Can Weigh Himself","Tern is drawing up a new table. The examiners have chained his balance beam to the bedrock and claimed the whole island as their standard weight.","Bedrock Mite","Released from the beam, the island settles a finger’s breadth into the water. Five mugs slide off a mantelpiece.",8,
                At(Haul,Crane,"Ballast chain","Haul the slack chain off the balance"),At(LandingAction.Cut,West,"Inspector’s seal","Cut the examiner’s lead seal"),At(Seat,East,"Free beam","Set the beam on Tern’s portable stand")),
            Crossing("penny-divide",SeaDuty.Blockade,"Small Change","Tern has broken the master weight into a thousand pennies. Patrols can confiscate one big weight, but have a harder time confiscating everybody’s pockets.","Pass the pocket fleet through the weighing line.","Heavy Purse","A thousand light boats sit a penny lower in the water, exactly as they should.",8,SeaJob.Cut,DriveOff,Relay),
            Landfall("penny-coat","The Empty Coat","The last mark in the ballast book is for a sailor lost decades ago. No living family can be found. The island offers to carry the weight together.","Hollow Diver","They hang the coat on the gangplank for the next person to come aboard cold.",8,
                At(Turn,West,"Ballast book","Open the book to the last mark"),At(Brace,Crane,"Community beam","Hold the beam for the common weighing"),At(LandingAction.Guide,Stairs,"Tern’s witness","Walk the witness to the coat on the gangplank"))),
        Isle("The Unnumbered Sea",8,"Window Shoal","Miri, lamp glazier",
            "Miri makes windows for lighthouses. She has been keeping the view from every window Gauge made her brick up. There are so many views in the shed they have started looking out at one another.","A pane of green glass with one bubble shaped like a gull",
            Crossing("window-cargo",SeaDuty.Convoy,"A Cargo of Views","Transporting a window face down drowns its view. Miri stacks them upright in a long, spectacularly top-heavy barge.","Bring the glazier’s views to the open shed.","Glasswing","One pane cracks. Through it Lio can see himself mending the crack, which saves a great deal of argument about how.",8,Tow,SeaJob.Guide,Relay),
            Landfall("window-shed","Across the Windowsill","The lock on the shed can only be reached through a view of the shed from the other side. The glazier needs somebody who knows their way around backwards.","Rearward Gull","The shed opens. A whole season of stale blue weather escapes.",8,
