            Crossing("window-rain",SeaDuty.Hunt,"A Squall in a Frame","One storm got out. It keeps trying to rain on the lighthouse it remembers. There has been a picnic ground there for twenty years.","Lead the displaced squall back out over the sea.","Rain on Glass","A single drop lands in the potato salad. Jo declares this statistically acceptable.",8,Track,Bait,DriveOff),
            Landfall("window-home","The View from Home","Pip asks for a window in the last engine cabin. Gauge has been working there for twenty years without seeing the houses her machine moves.","Glazier’s Hound","Gauge looks out. For a long time she does not ask for the name of anything she sees.",8,
