            Crossing("blank-board",SeaDuty.Salvage,"What a Chart Owes You","The public landing needs one thing to be safe: a board that marks the height of the tide. Elo’s is wedged under a wreck at the edge of the blank.","Recover the tide board and tow it to the public landing.","Margin Crab","The board reads one boot wet. Everyone agrees that more precision would be a waste of paint.",8,SeaJob.Cut,SeaJob.Salvage,Unload),
